Package: autoreportr
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Statistical Reporting with AI Interpretation
Version: 3.0.0
Date: 2026-11-04
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dona Ezechiel Stalec", "ALINKPESSO", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "alinkpessostalec9@gmail.com"),
    person("Jules", "DAH SEGBE", role = "ctb", comment = "Collaborateur"))
Description: Generates complete statistical reports in HTML, Word or PDF from
    a data frame: data quality, identifier detection, missing values,
    univariate and bivariate analysis, optional charts, automatic
    interpretations and a final summary. Users may supply their own Groq API
    key to obtain AI interpretations. A Shiny platform gives access to the
    same features. Developed in partnership with CRISTAL and BUE-ENSPD,
    Universite de Parakou.
